# ── Git worktrees ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Worktrees are checkouts OF this repo, not content IN it. `git add -A` sweeps
# them in as embedded repositories, recording a gitlink to a commit the repo
# does not contain — clones then get an empty directory and no way to fill it.
# Observed for real in this vault; not hypothetical.
.worktrees/
.codex-worktrees/
*.worktrees/


# ── Agent and tooling state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
